src/HalDisplay.h: setCustomLut(bool, const unsigned char*)
  Task D2 (#31) adds this pass-through to the firmware's lib/hal/HalDisplay.h
  (to FreeInkDisplay::setCustomLUT) for the RSVP trial display profiles. Only
  the device backend calls it (src/display/DeviceDisplayBackend.cpp, built
  without SIMULATOR); the simulator models refresh time, not waveforms, so the
  stub is a no-op and keeps the HAL surfaces the same.

